flowchart TD
  subgraph C["Trust boundary 1: untrusted client"]
    ACTOR["Student / teacher"] --> INPUT["Attempt ID / draft answer / expected version"]
  end
  subgraph S["Trusted server: Development-only synthetic session"]
    API["Resolve session subject and validate input"] --> CHECK["Attempt service and shared ACC-04 checks"]
    CHECK -->|Allow| IO["Read answer or update own draft with CAS"]
    CHECK -->|No session, deny or unavailable| DENY["Normalize rejection without resource details"]
    API -->|Transport validation failure: 400| OUT
    IO -->|Content or authorized version conflict| OUT["Public response"]
    IO -->|Snapshot changed or unavailable| DENY
    DENY -->|400 / 401 / generic 404| OUT
    IO -->|Actor, action, IDs, versions, outcome| AUD[("Metadata-only audit")]
    DENY -->|Internal reason and correlation| AUD
  end
  subgraph P["Trust boundary 2: trusted provider ports / simulator"]
    ID[("Accounts and course memberships")]
    ATT[("Attempt metadata and answers")]
  end
  INPUT -->|HTTP request| API
  CHECK -->|Account and course IDs| ID
  ID -->|Current account, membership or failure| CHECK
  CHECK -->|Attempt ID| ATT
  ATT -->|Ownership, course, state, version or failure| CHECK
  IO -->|Authorized snapshot and optional draft write| ATT
  ATT -->|Bound answer, next version or failure| IO
  OUT -->|HTTP status and permitted body| ACTOR
